# Tools this repository adds on top of the template kit: `<tool> <version> <source>`.
# Read by scripts/check-tool-versions.sh (drift) and scripts/install-extra-tools.sh (CI install).
# Ninja publishes no checksum file, so its row ends with a comment
# `# sha256 <digest of ninja-linux.zip>`; update the digest with the version.
# scripts/check-tool-versions.sh ignores the comment; the installer verifies it.
